  "content": "\n\n<p><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/MES/BH_ME_HEADER.webp\" alt=\"橫幅\"></p>\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fko-fi.com%252fD1D8LKA5N\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://ko-fi.com/img/githubbutton_sm.svg\" alt=\"Ko-fi\"></a></p>\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fdiscord.com%252finvite%252fS5nffJbuvA\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/discord/869218732650688543?color=9033af&label=DISCORD&style=for-the-badge\" alt=\"Discord\"></a> <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/finndog_123/projects\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/CurseForge-projects-9033af?style=for-the-badge&logo=curseforge\" alt=\"CurseForge 專案\"></a> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fuser%252fFinnDog_123\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/Modrinth-projects-9033af?style=for-the-badge&logo=modrinth\" alt=\"Modrinth 專案\"></a> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fpreviews.moogsmods.com%252fend-structures%252f1.21.1%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://pub-24a4e0e7ea8544a5b6f73c3a23512589.r2.dev/images/c110cc09347a4f9f9de6c974f2fa35d8.png\" alt=\"查看結構\"></a></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/MES/BH_ME_BANNER1.webp\" alt=\"遊戲概述\"></p>\n<p>此模組適用於 Forge、Fabric、NeoForge 與 Quilt！也可僅安裝於伺服器端。1.20.4 版本後已不再支援 Forge。</p>\n<h3>關於</h3>\n<p>Moog's End Structures 透過引入一系列新結構，為終界（End）維度注入全新活力，這些結構能完美融入原有地貌。每個結構皆精心打造，使用原版方塊與生物以保留經典的 Minecraft 風格。探索終界時，你將遭遇獨特的挑戰、強大的敵人與寶貴的戰利品。本模組可搭配任何整合包使用，並能與 Moog's Voyager Structures (MVS) 同時安裝，帶來更豐富的遊戲體驗。透過 Moog's End Structures 深入終界，發掘等待著你的隱藏寶藏吧！</p>\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fpreviews.moogsmods.com%252fend-structures%252f1.21.1%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://pub-24a4e0e7ea8544a5b6f73c3a23512589.r2.dev/images/f8fe835413394a76b10a678afefea30f.png\" alt=\"在 3D 環境中即時瀏覽所有結構\"></a></p>\n<p>歡迎前往 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/moogs-voyager-structures\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">這裡</a> 查看我們的主要結構模組 MVS。</p>\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fminecraftstorage.com%252fmods%252fmes-moogs-end-structures\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://imgur.com/ApCtgr7.png\" alt=\"MinecraftStorage\"></a></p>\n<div><h3><strong>Biomes O Plenty</strong> 相容性數據包</h3><br><div>我為 Moog's End Structures 開發了專屬的相容性數據包，以提升其與熱門模組 <strong>Biomes O Plenty</strong> 的整合度。此數據包會將部分既有結構的風格替換為 BOP 的方塊，讓兩個模組同時安裝時能呈現更連貫且沉浸的體驗。你可以在 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/data-packs/mes-biomes-o-plenty-compat-pack\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">這裡</a> 找到並下載該相容性數據包。</div></div>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h3>設定包</h3>\n<p>模組的所有細節均可透過數據包進行自訂。帶有完整說明文件的範本可於 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/mes-moogs-end-structures-config-pack\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">這裡</a> 取得。</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/MES/BH_ME_BANNER2.webp\" alt=\"功能特色\"> <img src=\"https://imgur.com/YPIvnN1.png\" alt=\"圖片拼貼\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/MES/BH_ME_BANNER2.webp\" alt=\"遊戲展示\"></p>\n<h3>影片</h3>\n<div><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><iframe src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/gqCYji1o2Xs?wmode=transparent&start=102\" width=\"320\" height=\"180\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><iframe src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/1XGKnGel1oI?wmode=transparent&start=239\" width=\"320\" height=\"180\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div>\n<div><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><iframe src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/khBGeEdrWuc?wmode=transparent\" width=\"320\" height=\"180\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div>\n<h3>整合包</h3>\n<p>查看所有整合包請點 <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.modpackindex.com%252fmodpack%252ffinder%253fincluded_mods%253d46028\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">這裡</a>。</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/MES/BH_ME_BANNER3.webp\" alt=\"Discord 伺服器\"></p>\n<p>獲得回覆最快且最推薦的方式是加入我們的 <a href=\"https://discord.gg/S5nffJbuvA\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Discord 伺服器</a>。</p>\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fbisecthosting.com%252fmoogsmods%253fr%253dcfmes\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/MES/BH_ME_PROMO.webp\" alt=\"Bisect Hosting 贊助\"></a></p>",
